// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 15
window.T15_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"anyhow – deepen","cards":[{"w":"anyhow","p":"adv.","d":"anyway; in any case; used to indicate that something happens despite what has been said","c":"無論如何；不管怎樣；總之","s":"I was not entirely sure how to solve the computer error, but I managed to get it working anyhow before the deadline.","t":"我不完全確定該如何解決電腦錯誤，但我還是在截止期限前無論如何／不管怎樣設法讓它恢復運轉了。"},{"w":"in any case","p":"phr.","d":"whatever happens; at any rate; regardless of other circumstances","c":"無論如何；不管怎樣；總之","s":"We might miss the early afternoon express train, but in any case we will arrive in Taipei before sunset.","t":"我們可能會錯過午後較早的直達快車，但無論如何我們都會在日落前抵達台北。"},{"w":"awkward","p":"adj.","d":"causing or feeling embarrassment; clumsy or difficult to deal with","c":"尷尬的；笨拙的；不自然的","s":"Ben looks rather awkward whenever he dances because he struggles to find the proper musical rhythm.","t":"每當班跳舞時他看起來都相當笨拙不自然，因為他很難跟上合適的音樂節奏。"},{"w":"awkwardness","p":"n.","d":"the state of being awkward, clumsy, or socially uncomfortable","c":"尷尬；笨拙；侷促不安（不可數）","s":"The cheerful host shared a funny personal joke to relieve the awkwardness among the newly introduced wedding guests.","t":"風趣開朗的主持人分享了一則好笑的個人笑話，以緩解新結識的婚禮賓客之間的尷尬侷促。"},{"w":"bacteria","p":"n. pl.","d":"microscopic living organisms, usually single-celled, that can be found everywhere and can cause illness","c":"細菌（複數名詞，單數為 bacterium）","s":"Medical scientists concluded that the sudden severe disease outbreak was directly caused by harmful bacteria in the drinking water.","t":"醫學家得出結論，這場突如其來的嚴重疾病爆發是由飲用水中附帶的有害細菌直接引起的。"},{"w":"beneath","p":"prep./adv.","d":"extending or directly underneath; at a lower level or under the surface of","c":"在…下方；在…底下（介系詞／副詞）","s":"Vinnie's fluffy white cat likes to sleep peacefully on a warm wool towel beneath the bed every winter afternoon.","t":"每到冬天的午後，文妮毛茸茸的白貓喜歡平靜地睡在床鋪底下溫暖的羊毛毛巾上。"},{"w":"bud","p":"n.","d":"a small lateral or terminal protuberance on the stem of a plant that may develop into a flower or leaf","c":"芽；花蕾；苞（可數）","s":"The intelligent teacher noticed bad cheating habits early and decided to nip the negative behavior in the bud.","t":"明智的老師很早就注意到了作弊的壞習慣，並決定將這種不良行為扼殺於萌芽階段／防微杜漸。"},{"w":"bud","p":"v.","d":"to put forth or produce buds; to begin to grow or develop","c":"發芽；萌芽；開始發展（動詞）","s":"When the freezing winter frost finally melts away, fruit trees across the sunny countryside begin to bud profusely.","t":"當酷寒的冬霜終於消融時，陽光明媚鄉間的果樹開始大量發芽／萌芽。"},{"w":"buzz","p":"v.","d":"to make a low, continuous humming sound; to be full of excitement or activity","c":"嗡嗡作響；嘁嘁喳喳；充滿興奮議論","s":"A noisy winged insect was constantly buzzing in my ear while I tried to read my book under the tree.","t":"當我試著在樹下看書時，一隻吵鬧的有翅昆蟲不斷在我的耳邊嗡嗡作響。"},{"w":"buzz","p":"n.","d":"a low, continuous humming sound, or a feeling of excitement or vitality","c":"嗡嗡聲；喧鬧聲；興奮狂熱（可數/不可數）","s":"We heard an unusual loud buzz in the distance and soon saw a red rescue helicopter hovering above the trees.","t":"我們聽見遠處傳來一陣不尋常且巨大的嗡嗡喧鬧聲，不久便看見一架紅色救援直升機盤旋在樹林上方。"},{"w":"deed","p":"n.","d":"an intentional action that is performed; an achievement or legal document","c":"行徑；事蹟；善行；契約（可數）","s":"The brave firefighter was officially awarded a gold medal of honor for his courageous and heroic deed.","t":"那位勇敢的消防隊員因其英勇無畏的英勇事蹟而被正式授予榮譽金質獎章。"},{"w":"deepen","p":"v.","d":"to make or become deep or deeper; to intensify or strengthen","c":"加深；深化；變深（動詞）","s":"The city government decided to deepen the muddy riverbed in order to prevent seasonal flooding during heavy typhoons.","t":"市政府決定加深泥濘的河床，以防止在強烈颱風期間發生季節性水災。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"experiment – majority","cards":[{"w":"experiment","p":"n.","d":"a scientific procedure undertaken to make a discovery, test a hypothesis, or demonstrate a known fact","c":"實驗；試驗（可數）","s":"University chemistry students put on safety goggles and began to conduct a delicate laboratory experiment with acids.","t":"大學化學系的學生們戴上護目鏡，開始用酸性物質進行一項精密的實驗室實驗。"},{"w":"experiment","p":"v.","d":"to perform a scientific procedure, or to try out new ideas or methods","c":"進行實驗；嘗試（動詞）","s":"Medical researchers decided to experiment on laboratory mice to discover whether the new vaccine produced side effects.","t":"醫學研究人員決定在實驗室小鼠身上做實驗，以發現這款新疫苗是否會產生副作用。"},{"w":"experimental","p":"adj.","d":"based on untested ideas or not yet fully developed or approved","c":"實驗性的；試驗階段的","s":"The brave patient agreed to receive an experimental drug treatment that had shown promising laboratory results.","t":"那位勇敢的病人同意接受一種在實驗室結果中顯示出良好前景的試驗性藥物治療。"},{"w":"fade","p":"v.","d":"to gradually grow faint and disappear, or to lose brightness, vivid color, or vitality","c":"褪色；漸漸消逝；變微弱（動詞）","s":"Rachel still cherishes her favorite cotton band shirt even though its bright colors have noticeably faded over the years.","t":"瑞秋仍然珍愛她最喜愛的純棉樂團T恤，儘管其鮮豔的色彩多年來已經明顯褪色。"},{"w":"fearful","p":"adj.","d":"feeling afraid, anxious, or showing fear; terrifying","c":"害怕的；擔憂的；恐懼的","s":"Residents living near the swelling river were extremely fearful that heavy rain would cause severe flooding tonight.","t":"住在暴漲河水附近的居民極度擔憂害怕今晚的大雨會造成嚴重的洪患。"},{"w":"fold","p":"v.","d":"to bend something over on itself so that one part of it covers another","c":"摺疊；對摺；交叉雙臂（動詞）","s":"The stubborn supervisor stood silently by the door and folded his arms across his broad chest during the meeting.","t":"在會議期間，那位固執的主管靜靜地站在門邊，雙臂交叉抱於寬闊的胸前。"},{"w":"fold","p":"n.","d":"a form or shape produced by the turning over of a layer of a material on itself","c":"摺痕；摺層；起伏（可數）","s":"A frightened little gray mouse hid quietly behind a thick fold of the heavy velvet curtain in the living room.","t":"一隻受驚嚇的灰色小老鼠悄悄躲在客廳厚重天鵝絨窗簾的厚實摺層後面。"},{"w":"indoor","p":"adj.","d":"situated, conducted, or suitable for use inside a building","c":"室內的；戶內的（形容詞，置於名詞前）","s":"The luxurious modern fitness center features a heated indoor swimming pool that members can enjoy throughout the chilly winter.","t":"這家豪華現代健身中心設有溫水室內游泳池，會員在寒冷的整個冬天都可以盡情享受。"},{"w":"indoors","p":"adv.","d":"into or within a building; not outside","c":"在室內；向室內（副詞）","s":"Because a violent typhoon was approaching the island, local authorities advised all citizens to stay indoors until the storm passed.","t":"因為強烈颱風正在逼近該島，當地政府建議所有市民留在室內，直到暴風雨過去。"},{"w":"leak","p":"v.","d":"to accidentally lose or admit contents, especially liquid or gas, through a hole or crack","c":"滲漏；漏出；洩漏（動詞）","s":"During the torrential midnight downpour, dirty rainwater began to leak through the old roof and damaged the ceiling.","t":"在午夜的傾盆大雨中，骯髒的雨水開始從老舊屋頂滲漏下來，損壞了天花板。"},{"w":"leak","p":"n.","d":"a hole or crack through which liquid or gas can enter or escape, or an unauthorized disclosure","c":"漏洞；滲漏處；洩密（可數）","s":"The experienced plumber arrived with his heavy tool bag to inspect the bathroom pipes and fix a serious water leak.","t":"經驗豐富的水電工帶著沉重的工具袋抵達，檢查浴室管線並修補嚴重的漏水滲漏處。"},{"w":"limb","p":"n.","d":"an arm or leg of a person or four-legged animal, or a large branch of a tree","c":"肢體；手足；大樹枝（可數）","s":"After hiking up the steep rocky mountain trail for seven continuous hours, Mary sat on a boulder to rest her aching limbs.","t":"在陡峭的岩石山徑上連續健行七個小時後，瑪麗坐在巨石上休息她痠痛的四肢。"},{"w":"majority","p":"n.","d":"the greater number or part; more than half of a total","c":"大多數；過半數（通常單數）","s":"The recent nationwide survey revealed that the vast majority of high school students prefer digital textbooks over paper ones.","t":"最近的全國性調查顯示，絕大多數高中生偏好數位電子教科書更甚於紙本書籍。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"misery – shorten","cards":[{"w":"misery","p":"n.","d":"a state or feeling of great physical or mental distress, discomfort, or suffering","c":"痛苦；苦難；悲慘境遇（不可數/可數）","s":"Innocent rural families lived in profound misery for decades after the destructive civil war ruined their farmlands.","t":"在破壞性的內戰摧毀了他們的農田之後，無辜的農村家庭在深重的痛苦與苦難中生活了數十年。"},{"w":"miserable","p":"adj.","d":"wretchedly unhappy, uncomfortable, or contemptible","c":"悲慘的；痛苦難堪的；令人沮喪的","s":"Cold winter rain and freezing winds made the entire afternoon feel thoroughly miserable for the waiting commuters.","t":"冰冷的冬雨與刺骨的寒風，讓等車的通勤族整個下午都感到無比陰鬱難受。"},{"w":"panic","p":"n.","d":"sudden uncontrollable fear or anxiety, often causing wildly unthinking behavior","c":"恐慌；驚惶（通常單數）","s":"When the loud fire alarm suddenly sounded through the crowded department store, customers were in a state of sudden panic.","t":"當刺耳的火災警報突然在擁擠的百貨公司響起時，顧客們陷入了一陣突如其來的恐慌狀態中。"},{"w":"panic","p":"v.","d":"to feel or cause to feel sudden uncontrollable fear or anxiety","c":"恐慌；驚慌失措（動詞，變化：panicked, panicked）","s":"Passengers aboard the ferry began to panic when thick black smoke poured from the ship's engine room.","t":"當濃厚的黑煙從船艙機房冒出時，渡輪上的乘客開始驚慌失措。"},{"w":"portion","p":"n.","d":"a part of any whole, either separated from or integrated with it; a serving of food","c":"一份（食物）；一部分（可數）","s":"The traditional countryside restaurant serves a generous portion of grilled chicken with crispy roasted potatoes.","t":"那家傳統鄉村餐廳提供份量豐盛的一大份烤雞搭配酥脆烤馬鈴薯。"},{"w":"portion","p":"v.","d":"to divide something into parts and share it out","c":"分配；分派；把…分成多份（動詞）","s":"During the camping expedition, leaders had to portion out clean drinking water strictly to ensure everyone had enough.","t":"在露營探險期間，領隊們必須嚴格分派配給乾淨的飲用水，以確保每個人都足夠飲用。"},{"w":"reserve","p":"v.","d":"to retain for future use; to arrange for a room, seat, or ticket to be kept for someone","c":"預訂；保留（動詞）","s":"Because Saturday evenings are extremely busy downtown, Peter called ahead to reserve a table for four at the bistro.","t":"因為週六晚間市中心極為繁忙，彼得提前打電話給小酒館預訂了一張四人餐桌。"},{"w":"reserve","p":"n.","d":"a supply of a commodity not needed for immediate use; a protected area for wildlife","c":"儲備量；保護區；矜持內斂（可數/不可數）","s":"Geologists estimate that the Middle Eastern nation holds approximately eighteen percent of the world's proven crude oil reserves.","t":"地質學家估計，這個中東國家擁有全球約百分之十八的已探明原油儲備量。"},{"w":"reservation","p":"n.","d":"an arrangement to secure accommodations or seats; a feeling of doubt","c":"預訂；預約；存疑保留（可數/不可數）","s":"We should make a hotel reservation at least two weeks before traveling during the crowded summer vacation.","t":"在擁擠的暑假期間旅遊前，我們應該至少提前兩週完成飯店預訂。"},{"w":"restrict","p":"v.","d":"to put a limit on; to keep under control or within bounds","c":"限制；約束（動詞）","s":"To preserve the historic stone ruins, the national park strictly restricts daily tourist entries to five hundred people.","t":"為了保護歷史悠久的石頭遺跡，國家公園嚴格將每日遊客入園人數限制在五百人以內。"},{"w":"restriction","p":"n.","d":"a limiting condition or measure, especially a legal regulation","c":"限制；約束規定（可數/不可數）","s":"Airport customs authorities announced that strict international travel restrictions would remain in effect until next month.","t":"機場海關當局宣布，嚴格的國際旅行限制規定將維持生效至下個月。"},{"w":"routine","p":"n.","d":"a sequence of actions regularly followed; a fixed program","c":"例行公事；日常慣例（可數/不可數）","s":"Laura's healthy daily routine includes jogging for thirty minutes in the park and preparing fresh green smoothies.","t":"蘿拉健康的日常例行常規包括在公園慢跑三十分鐘以及製作新鮮的綠色蔬果昔。"},{"w":"routine","p":"adj.","d":"performed as part of a regular procedure rather than for a special reason","c":"常規的；例行的；平常的","s":"The experienced pilot completed all standard and routine safety checks before steering the plane onto the runway.","t":"經驗豐富的機師在將飛機駛入跑道前，完成了所有標準且例行的安全檢查。"},{"w":"shadow","p":"n.","d":"a dark area or shape produced by a body coming between rays of light and a surface","c":"陰影；影子；陰暗處（可數/不可數）","s":"When walking through the sunny park, the playful puppy barked excitedly at its own moving shadow on the grass.","t":"走過陽光明媚的公園時，愛玩的小狗對著草地上自己移動的影子興奮地汪汪叫。"},{"w":"shorten","p":"v.","d":"to make or become shorter in length, duration, or distance","c":"縮短；變短（動詞）","s":"Cherry decided to shorten the length of her overseas trip so that she could return home in time for her sister's wedding.","t":"雀莉決定縮短她海外旅行的長度，以便她能及時趕回家參加姊姊的婚禮。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"shortly – trend","cards":[{"w":"shortly","p":"adv.","d":"in a short time; soon; at a short interval","c":"不久；立刻；很快（副詞）","s":"Please take a comfortable seat in the waiting lounge; the chief doctor will examine you shortly once he finishes surgery.","t":"請在候診室找個舒適的座位稍坐；主任醫生一完成手術就很快／立刻會為你看診。"},{"w":"signal","p":"n.","d":"a gesture, action, or sound that gives information or instructions; an electrical impulse or radio wave","c":"信號；暗號；通訊訊號（可數）","s":"The intense bicycle street race officially began when the traffic signal overhead changed rapidly from red to bright green.","t":"當頭頂上的交通號誌／信號迅速由紅燈轉變為亮綠燈時，激烈的自行車街道賽正式展開。"},{"w":"signal","p":"v.","d":"to convey information or instructions by means of a gesture, action, or sound","c":"發出信號；示意；標誌著（動詞）","s":"The caring elementary teacher gently signaled to the noisy students to sit down quietly and open their textbooks.","t":"那位充滿關愛的小學老師溫和地向吵鬧的學生打手勢示意，讓他們安靜坐好並打開教科書。"},{"w":"spit","p":"v.","d":"to eject saliva or food forcibly from one's mouth","c":"吐出；吐口水（動詞，三態：spit/spat, spit/spat, spit）","s":"It is considered extremely rude and unhygienic in civilized modern societies to spit carelessly on public walkways.","t":"在文明的現代社會中，在公共人行道上隨地吐痰／吐口水被視為極其粗魯且不衛生的行為。"},{"w":"spit","p":"n.","d":"saliva, especially that which is ejected from the mouth; a light fall of rain","c":"口水；唾液；微雨（不可數）","s":"A small spit of afternoon rain began to sprinkle on our umbrellas as we walked along the windy riverbank.","t":"當我們沿著風大的河岸漫步時，一陣陣午後微雨開始灑落在我們的雨傘上。"},{"w":"spy","p":"n.","d":"a person employed by a government or organization to obtain secret information on enemies or competitors","c":"間諜；特務；臥底（可數）","s":"The captured military spy was immediately locked inside a secure underground facility for intense government interrogation.","t":"那名被俘虜的軍事間諜立刻被關押在一處安全的地下設施中，接受嚴格的政府審訊。"},{"w":"spy","p":"v.","d":"to observe secretively; to discern or see, especially with difficulty","c":"從事間諜活動；暗中窺探；發現看見（動詞）","s":"Alice hid behind the living room bookshelf to spy on her older brother and discover where he hid his diary.","t":"愛麗絲躲在客廳書架後面暗中窺探她的哥哥，想查出他把日記藏在哪裡。"},{"w":"superior","p":"adj.","d":"higher in rank, status, quality, or achievement than another","c":"較優良的；品質上乘的；上級的","s":"These handmade leather hiking boots are significantly more expensive because they are manufactured with superior craftsmanship.","t":"這些手工皮革登山靴明顯更為昂貴，因為它們是用上乘優質的精湛工藝製造的。"},{"w":"superior","p":"n.","d":"a person higher in rank or status than another","c":"上司；長官；長輩（可數）","s":"Dean scheduled a formal private meeting with his direct superior because he needed to request two weeks of leave.","t":"狄恩與他的直屬上級主管安排了一次正式的私人會面，因為他需要請假兩週。"},{"w":"talkative","p":"adj.","d":"fond of or given to talking; loquacious","c":"健談的；多話的；愛說話的","s":"While Rebecca is quiet and thoughtful, her younger sister is an energetic and extraordinarily talkative girl who loves making friends.","t":"雖然蕾貝卡文靜且深思熟慮，但她的妹妹卻是一個充滿活力且極其健談多話的女孩，喜歡結交朋友。"},{"w":"tame","p":"adj.","d":"domesticated, gentle, and obedient; not dangerous or wild","c":"溫馴的；馴服的；平淡無奇的","s":"The gentle and tame brown horse on the educational farm is so calm that small children can safely ride it.","t":"教育農場上那匹溫柔且溫馴的棕馬非常沉穩平靜，小孩子可以安全地騎乘牠。"},{"w":"tame","p":"v.","d":"to domesticate a wild animal; to make something less powerful or dangerous","c":"馴化；馴服；克制平息（動詞）","s":"Experienced zoologists explain that humans can never truly tame a fierce adult wolf because its wild hunting instincts remain strong.","t":"經驗豐富的動物學家解釋說，人類永遠無法真正馴服一隻兇猛的成年野狼，因為其野外狩獵本能依然強大。"},{"w":"trend","p":"n.","d":"a general direction in which something is developing or changing; a prevailing fashion","c":"趨勢；潮流；動向（可數）","s":"Carrie always reads international design magazines to stay informed about the latest clothing trends for the upcoming winter season.","t":"凱莉總是閱讀國際設計雜誌，以便隨時掌握即將到來的冬季最新服裝潮流趨勢。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"tropical – wrist","cards":[{"w":"tropical","p":"adj.","d":"characteristic of or situated in the tropics, the region surrounding the equator","c":"熱帶的；炎熱潮濕的","s":"Tourists traveling across Southeast Asia fell in love with sweet tropical fruits like mangoes, papayas, and pineapples.","t":"在東南亞旅行的遊客愛上了芒果、木瓜和鳳梨等香甜的熱帶水果。"},{"w":"twist","p":"v.","d":"to turn or bend something into a specified position; to injure a joint by an unnatural wrench","c":"轉動；旋轉；扭傷；扭曲（動詞）","s":"You need to gently twist the metal bottle cap clockwise in order to seal the container tightly.","t":"你需要順時針輕輕轉動金屬瓶蓋，以便將容器密封嚴實。"},{"w":"twist","p":"n.","d":"an unexpected change in a process or development; a sharp bend in a road","c":"轉折；意想不到的轉變；彎道（可數）","s":"The mystery detective movie had an incredible plot twist at the very end that completely astonished the audience.","t":"這部懸疑偵探電影在片尾有一個令人難以置信的情節大反轉，徹底震撼了全體觀眾。"},{"w":"victim","p":"n.","d":"a person harmed, injured, or killed as a result of a crime, accident, or disaster","c":"受害者；罹難者；受難人（可數）","s":"Volunteers collected clothing, blankets, and emergency medical supplies to support innocent victims of the devastating earthquake.","t":"志工們收集了衣物、毛毯和緊急醫療物資，以援助這場毀滅性地震中的無辜受災民眾／受害者。"},{"w":"wage","p":"n.","d":"a fixed regular payment earned for work or services, typically paid on a daily or weekly basis","c":"工資；薪水（通常用複數 wages）","s":"The government passed a new national labor law that substantially raised the legal minimum wage for young workers.","t":"政府通過了一項新的國家勞動法規，大幅調高了年輕勞工的法定最低工資。"},{"w":"wage","p":"v.","d":"to carry on a war or campaign against someone or something","c":"發動；發起（戰爭、運動）（動詞）","s":"The small peaceful nation was forced to wage an intense defensive war against foreign invaders for five years.","t":"這個熱愛和平的小國被迫發動了一場持續五年的激烈防衛戰，以抵禦外國侵略者。"},{"w":"wagon","p":"n.","d":"a four-wheeled vehicle for carrying heavy loads, typically pulled by horses or a tractor","c":"四輪運貨馬車；手拉推車（可數）","s":"The farmer loaded hundreds of fresh red apples into his sturdy wooden wagon and drove it to the village market.","t":"農夫將數百顆新鮮紅蘋果裝進堅固的木質四輪運貨馬車中，然後駕車前往村莊市集。"},{"w":"wrist","p":"n.","d":"the joint connecting the hand with the forearm","c":"手腕；腕關節（可數）","s":"Manny wore a handsome gold watch on his left wrist that had been given to him as a graduation gift.","t":"曼尼在左手腕上戴著一只精美的金錶，那是作為畢業禮物送給他的。"}]}];
